{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/996","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/996/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/996/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/996/events","html_url":"https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/996","id":262775450,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNjI3NzU0NTA=","number":996,"title":"Lazy relations and Query Builder join","user":{"login":"dlindenkreuz","id":509681,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwOTY4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/509681?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlindenkreuz","html_url":"https://github.com/dlindenkreuz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlindenkreuz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlindenkreuz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlindenkreuz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlindenkreuz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlindenkreuz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlindenkreuz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlindenkreuz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlindenkreuz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlindenkreuz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":333605711,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMzM2MDU3MTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null},{"id":718929567,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MTg5Mjk1Njc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/labels/comp:%20lazy%20loading","name":"comp: lazy loading","color":"1d76db","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2017-10-04T12:51:53Z","updated_at":"2017-11-22T09:02:27Z","closed_at":"2017-11-22T09:01:57Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When using the query builder's `leftJoinAndSelect` with lazy relations (defined with `Promise<Entity>`), the relation does not get added to the result as a \"regular\" property. The actual data can be found at the double-underscore key (ex. `__room__` instead of `room`). The async accessor is still attached.\r\n\r\nThis means that accessing a lazy relation that was fetched eagerly using `leftJoinAndSelect` will actually fetch the data twice. This leads to a lot of unnecessary queries when the result list is already long.\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nconst x = await getRepository(Share)\r\n    .createQueryBuilder(\"share\")\r\n    .leftJoinAndSelect(\"share.room\", \"room\")\r\n    .getMany()\r\n// → SELECT [...etc.] FROM \"share\" \"share\" LEFT JOIN \"room\" \"room\" ON \"room\".\"id\"=\"share\".\"roomId\"\r\nconsole.log(x[0])\r\n// → Share { id: 1, [...etc.]  __room__: Room { [...etc.] } }\r\nconsole.log(x[0].room)\r\n// → Promise\r\nconsole.log(await x[0].room)\r\n// → SELECT [...etc.] FROM \"room\" \"room\" INNER JOIN \"share\" \"Share\" ON \"Share\".\"roomId\" = \"room\".\"id\" WHERE \"room\".\"id\" = $1\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected behaviour:**\r\nWhen a relation is defined as lazy and is fetched eagerly using the query builder, existing data should be used and no additional SQL query should be made.\r\n\r\n**Typeorm version:** 0.1.0-alpha.50","closed_by":{"login":"pleerock","id":1753397,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTMzOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1753397?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock","html_url":"https://github.com/pleerock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/996/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/996/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}